DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T120000
SUMMARY:Weekend Warrior Tennis (Saturdays)
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nJoin us for
  friendly and sociable free rallies and possibly some informal matches for
  training and fun. We are beginner to intermediate levels but all are welc
 ome. We don’t allow formal instruction on our group-reserved courts\, al
 though giving some quick tips is OK so long as you’re not holding up oth
 ers waiting to play.\n\n⛑️ **Clinic Matches:** If we have to rotate pe
 ople in then we may play some clinic-style matches where everyone rotates 
 in evenly. There is no holding the court via wins so everyone has a chance
  to play regardless of skill level.\n\n🕊️ **Early Bird Start:** If yo
 u want to meet earlier than 9 AM (like 8 or 8:30) then please let us know 
 by the day before and we’ll see who can join you (usually I can do earli
 er).\n\n**🎾 Equipment:** Please bring your own racquet and water\, as w
 e don’t provide those. I always have some balls for at least one court\,
  but feel free to bring your own in case we need to branch out over more t
 han one court.\n\n👟 **Court Priority:** Those who are signed up and sho
 w up by 9 AM will have top priority for court space. Those who show up lat
 er have second priority while those who are wait-listed will have third pr
 iority. This is only in the event that we have to rotate people in.\n\n**
 🧯DISCLAIMER:** Courts are subject to availability and weather. If you m
 ake plans to attend please be prepared to cancel or adjust our location as
  needed. Furthermore\, by attending you agree to be fully responsible for 
 your own health and safety. Each person is responsible to take a break for
  rest and water at their own discretion.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/317130215/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261025T131223Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261025T131223Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
