SUMMARY:Ping Pong Party - North Jersey 
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nWe're a gro
 up of people who will casually hit the ball around and rotate playing to 1
 0 or 15 points for two to three hours. We may do king of the hill\, round 
 robin\, a small tournament or some other organized games. Comment below wi
 th your interests and ideas!\n\nAll are welcome!! It's just casual fun! Co
 me anytime! We're not in a league and are not here to analyze your form.\n
 \nWe'll be heading indoors to the table tennis tables at Ready to Golf\, 3
  New Bridge Road in River Edge. We'll likely have pizza delivered or hang 
 out some more at a nearby diner or bar.\n\nReady to Golf has a lot to offe
 r\, including rentable table tennis tables\, and comes as a recommendation
  of Joe\, one of our many regulars.\n\nWe'll be reserving 5-6 tables for s
 ingles and doubles play but we may get more if they're available and if mo
 re than 30 people show up. When out playing\, make sure to include others 
 if people are waiting off to the side.\n\nThe rental price covers paddles 
 and balls. Final pricing will be somewhere in the neighborhood of $10-15 p
 er person. Please bring cash to pay for what you owe! We'll settle the bil
 l before play.\n\nIf you're stopping by later than 8:15 p.m.\, please let 
 me know by commenting below\, or calling or texting me. That would be help
 ful for planning purposes.\n\nThere is a snack bar on site open until 7:30
  p.m. There are some bottled drinks available and a water fountain. But yo
 u're welcome to bring food and beverages from the outside. It's BYOB frien
 dly. There's also plenty of seating and space for hanging out on the side 
 when not playing and some televisions with sports programming.\n\nIf inter
 ested in learning more about the place\, here's the website: www.readytogo
 lf.com\n\nHope you'll join us for our seventh ping pong event. Questions\,
  comments\, concerns or having trouble finding us? You can message Andy Mi
 lone on Meetup\, or call/text him at 201-234-9609.\n\nIf interested\, chec
 k out one of our many other events. We do bowling\, volleyball\, tennis\, 
 soccer\, hiking\, martial arts\, billiards\, dancing and bar crawls: [www.
 meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleyball](https://www.meetup.com/
 north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleyball)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/317067180/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261021T003516Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261021T003516Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
