SUMMARY:Adult Laser Tag - Edgewater
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nNxGn Arena\
 , 43 The Promenade\, Edgewater\, offers adult laser tag. So\, here we go. 
 We'll be heading there at 5 p.m. Saturday\, Nov. 28. The event idea comes 
 to you courtesy of Osama and our WhatsApp group chat.\n\nA reservation wil
 l likely be required. Cost is looking like it could be $40 to $80 per pers
 on depending on the event package and group size.\n\nI'll keep you updated
  as we get closer to the date. Here is the website: https://nxgnarena.com\
 n\n\\*\\*\\*There is a good chance we'll hang out some more at a diner or 
 bar afterward. Feel free to make suggestions!! \\*\\*\\*\n\nThis is our fi
 rst laser tag event. Feel free to also check out bowling\, soccer\, volley
 ball\, tennis or one of our other activities at: www.meetup.com/north-jers
 ey-bowling-soccer-volleyball.\n\nQuestions or comments? You can message An
 dy on Meetup\, or call/text him at 201-234-9609.\n\nPAYMENT INFO: I've got
  Venmo\, Zelle\, PayPal and Cash App. Try to locate my account with my ema
 il first. [andymilone@verizon.net](mailto:andymilone@verizon.net) Or it ma
 y show up under my name Andy Milone or Andrew Milone. Or try 201-406-7222.
  You can try my other number\, 201-234-9609\, BUT PLEASE DON'T USE IT FOR 
 VENMO! That is no longer my account. Thank you everyone!!! Feel free to re
 ach out with any questions!!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/316744336/
